00:07:18,750 --> 00:07:24,750
The incredible true story of the band that defined an era.

2
00:14:37,500 --> 00:14:43,500
Supersonic is a music, documentary, history film directed by Mat Whitecross.

3
00:21:56,250 --> 00:22:02,250
Supersonic charts the meteoric rise of Oasis from the council estates of Manchester to
some of the biggest concerts of all time in just three short years.

4
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:21,000
This palpable, raw and moving film shines a light on one of the most genre and generation-defining British bands that has ever existed
and features candid new interviews with Noel and Liam Gallagher, their mother, and members of the band and road crew.

