Oasis: Supersonic is a 2016 British music documentary film directed
by Mat Whitecross about the English rock band Oasis.

12
01:27:45,000 --> 01:27:51,000
Asif Kapadia and James Gay-Rees, already awarded an Academy Award for the film Amy,
worked on this film respectively as executive producer and film producer.

13
